<strong>Note:</strong> <em>Interesting. Even though the player had no knowledge of SCP-939, the object was still able to generate the correct effect. This indicates that while the object is capable of reading minds (as seen with the various &quot;something I would like&quot; tests,&quot; it can also assess information from other sources. However, the &quot;fubuki ni korosareru&quot; tests also show that it has trouble objectively evaluating terms with more than one possible meaning. Later I intend to determine exactly how it finds this information - either by reading other minds beyond the subject's, or by somehow referencing objective information, or some other means entirely.</em></p>
